1
00:00:03,670 --> 00:00:04,796
Professor.

2
00:00:06,715 --> 00:00:08,425
You're already giving it
your all.

3
00:00:08,925 --> 00:00:10,176
Then I'll do even better.

4
00:00:10,343 --> 00:00:12,053
You're already doing great.

5
00:00:15,724 --> 00:00:16,724
Professor.

6
00:00:18,393 --> 00:00:19,393
Dong-uk.

7
00:00:21,855 --> 00:00:22,855
Professor.

8
00:00:36,369 --> 00:00:37,247
It's been so long

9
00:00:37,248 --> 00:00:38,448
since I've been out like this.

10
00:00:38,788 --> 00:00:40,352
What do you usually do

11
00:00:40,353 --> 00:00:41,740
besides practicing?

12
00:00:42,751 --> 00:00:44,167
You seem like the type

13
00:00:44,168 --> 00:00:45,712
to spend time
in the practice room.

14
00:00:46,212 --> 00:00:47,338
Do I really seem like that?

15
00:00:50,467 --> 00:00:52,385
I haven't been out much lately

16
00:00:52,385 --> 00:00:54,554
but I usually walk a lot

17
00:00:54,554 --> 00:00:56,389
and read books.

18
00:00:56,389 --> 00:00:57,901
Maybe that's why

19
00:00:57,902 --> 00:00:59,542
today feels so special.
